<title>USA: TENNIS - MONDAY'S SAN JOSE MEN'S RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS - MONDAY'S SAN JOSE MEN'S RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, California 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the</p>
<p>$303,000 Sybase Open tennis tournament on Monday (Prefix</p>
<p>number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>First round</p>
<p>2-Michael Chang (U.S.) beat Mashika Washington (U.S.) 6-2 6-0</p>
<p>4-Todd Martin (U.S.) beat Steve Bryan (U.S.) 6-1 6-4</p>
<p>8-Chris Woodruff (U.S.) beat  Jean Philippe Fleurian (France)</p>
<p>6-2 6-3</p>
<p>Justin Gimelstob (U.S.) beat Michael Joyce (U.S.) 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Brett Steven (New Zealand) beat Nicolas Pereira (Venezuela)</p>
<p>6-1 7-5</p>
<p>Jeff Tarango (U.S.) beat Tommy Ho (U.S.) 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>Magnus Norman (Sweden) beat Cecil Mamiit (U.S.) 7-6 (7-4) 6-0</p>
</text>
